    "Our Sunday services, Tuesday services, and prayer sessions are shared on Facebook. Visit the page to watch the latest message or join us live.": "Imilimo yesu iya Sunday, imilimo ya Tuesday, ne fiputulwa fya mapepo fyalyakanishiwa pa Facebook. Tandalileni ibuula pakuti mumone ubukombe ubupya nangu ukutusangwako.",
