    "Our greatest assignment": "Umulimo wesu uwacilapo",
    "Our heart is simple: to win souls for Christ and help every believer grow into the fullness of what God has called them to be. Whether you are new to faith or returning after a season away, there is a place for you here.": "Umutima wesu waliyanguka: ukucimfya imipashi kuli Kristu no kwafwilisha umusumina onse ukukula mu kufikilishiwa kwa cintu Lesa amwitile ukuba. Nangu uli upya mu citetekelo nelyo ulebwelela pa numa ya nshita imo iya kutali, kuli icifulo kuli iwe pano.",
    "Our heart is to win souls for Christ, disciple believers, and serve our community with compassion. We gather for Sunday celebration, Tuesday service, prayer and intercession, and times of worship led by our choirs and praise team.": "Umutima wesu wa kucimfya imipashi kuli Kristu, abasambi abasumina, no kubombela umushi wesu ne nkumbu. Tulongana ku kusefya kwa Sunday, umulimo wa Tuesday, ipepo no kupapaata, ne nshita sha kupepa ishitungululwa na makwaya yesu ne bumba lya kulumbanya.",
    "Our heritage": "Ilyashi lyesu lya ku mupashi",
    "Our main church family gathers in Chawama for Sunday and Tuesday services. Please call ahead for the exact venue and directions.": "Ulupwa lwesu ulwa cilonganino ulukalamba lwalongana mu Chawama ku milimo ya Sunday na Tuesday. Mukwai itani intanshi pa kuti mwishibe icifulo ca kucitilo bunte ne fyo mwingaya.",
    "Our main gathering is in Chawama, Lusaka, with a branch being planted in Chongwe. Call the church office for the latest details.": "Ukulongana kwesu ukwakulisha kuli mu Chawama, Lusaka, no musambo ulebikwa mu Chongwe. Itani ofeshi lya calici pa kuti mubelenge ifyebo fya nomba line.",
    "Our main gathering is in Chawama, Lusaka. Please call ahead for the exact venue, directions, and transport help. A branch is also being planted in Chongwe.": "Ukulongana kwesu ukwakulisha kuli mu Chawama, Lusaka. Mukwai itani intanshi pa kuti mwishibe icifulo, inshila, no kwafwilisha kwa fya kutwala. Umusambo na kabili ulebikwa mu Chongwe.",
