    "Our prayer and intercession sessions are announced on Facebook. Follow the page so you do not miss the next live session.": "Ifiputulwa fyesu ifya kupepa no kupapaata fyabilishiwa pa Facebook. Konkeni ibuula pakuti mwilufya iciputulwa cakonkapo.",
    "Our prayer is that the same grace upon AGCOM and SCOAN will continue to rest upon Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia and upon every soul we reach.": "Ipepo lyesu lya kuti uluse lumo lune pa AGCOM na SCOAN lukatwalilila ukutuusha pa Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia na pa mweo onse uo tufikako.",
    "Our services include praise, prayer, and practical teaching from Scripture.": "Imilimo yesu yasanshamo ukulumbanya, ipepo, no kusambilisha kwabomba ukufuma mu Malembo.",
