    "Soul winning is the heartbeat of Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia. Jesus came to seek and save the lost, and He has sent every believer to share that same love.": "Ukucimfya kwa mweo ni nshita ya mutima iya Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia. Yesu aishile ku kufwaya no kupususha abaonaika, kabili atumine umusumina onse ukusangwa kuli ulya kutemwa kumo kwine.",
