    "Souls for Christ": "Imipashi kuli Kristu",
    "Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia": "Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia",
    "Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia is a Christian ministry based in Chawama, Lusaka. We are a family of believers who love God, honour His Word, and believe in the power of the Holy Spirit.": "Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia ni mulimo wa Bwina Kristu uwashintilila pa Chawama, Lusaka. Tuli lupwa lwa basumina abatemwa Lesa, abacindika Icebo Cakwe, kabili abasumina mu maka ya Mupashi wa Mushilo.",
    "Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia is a Spirit-filled church family in Chawama, Lusaka. We gather to worship God, grow in His Word, pray with faith, and reach our community with the love of Jesus Christ.": "Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia ni lupwa lwa cilonganino ulwaiswilemo Umupashi mu Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia, Lusaka. Tulongana ku kupepa Lesa, ukukula mu Cebo Cakwe, ukupepa ne citetekelo, no kufika ku cifulo cesu no kutemwa kwa kwa Yesu Kristu.",
