    "Stand with the church in prayer.": "Iminine ne calici mu mapepo.",
    "Standing in the gap for the church, families, and those in need, and supporting one another with practical love.": "Ukuimininako mu ciputulwa ca nshita ku calici, ku ndupwa, na ku balekabila, no kwafwilishanya no kutemwa ukwabomba.",
    "Standing in the gap for the church, the nation, and those in need through consistent prayer.": "Ukwiminina mu ciputulwa ca nshita ku calici, uluko, na abo abalekabila ukupitila mu kupepa ukwa lyonse.",
