    "Stay connected": "Twalilileni ukuminkanya",
    "Stay rooted in Scripture. Keep your heart open to the Holy Spirit. Trust that God is working even when you cannot see the whole picture. His timing is perfect, and His love for you is sure.": "Ukutwalilila ukubika imishila mu Malembo. Sunga umutima obe uwaisuka kuli Mupashi wa Mushilo. Shininkisheni ukuti Lesa alebomba nangu ca kuti tamulemona fyonse. Inshita yakwe yalipwililika, kabili ukutemwa Kwakwe kuli imwe kwashininkishiwa.",
    "Stories of His faithfulness in our church family.": "Amalyashi ya cishinka Cakwe mu lupwa lwesu ulwa cilonganino.",
