    "Sunday Celebration — 09:30 to 11:00 · Tuesday Service — 20:00 · Chawama, Lusaka.": "Ukusefya kwa nshita ya ku numa — 09:30 ukufika kuli 11:00 · Umulimo wa nshita ya ku ntanshi — 20:00 · Ukusefya kwa nshita ya ku ntanshi.",
    "Sunday Celebration: 09:30 – 11:00": "Ukusefya: 09:30 - 11:00",
    "Sunday and Tuesday services, choirs, prayer, outreach, and community care continue to reach souls for Christ.": "Imilimo ya Sunday na Tuesday, amakwaya, ipepo, ukufika ku bantu, no kusakamana kwa cikaya fyalitwalilila ukufika ku myeo kuli Kristu.",
