    "Support welfare, weddings, funerals, and families walking through hard seasons.": "Ukutungilila ubusuma, amacupo, ukulila, ne ndupwa ishilepita mu nshita sha mafya.",
    "Supporting the work of the ministry, our choirs, and the practical needs of the church.": "Ukutungilila umulimo wa mulimo, amakwaya yesu, ne fya kufwaya fya kubomfya ifya calici.",
    "Take a moment to breathe, read, and pray. God’s Word is a lamp to your feet and a light to your path.": "Ukupoka inshita ya kupuma, ukubelenga, no kupepa. Ishiwi lya kwa Lesa ni lampi ku makasa yenu no lubuuto ku nshila yenu.",
    "Take a moment with God": "Ukupokako akashita na Lesa .",
    "Take the Sunday and Tuesday messages home with you.": "Ukutwala amashiwi ya Sunday na Tuesday ku ng’anda pamo na iwe.",
    "Take the message home with you. These short notes gather the themes God has been speaking through our Sunday and Tuesday services.": "Ukutwala imbila ku ng’anda pamo na imwe. Aya amanoti ayapiipi yalonganika imitwe Lesa alelanda ukupitila mu milimo yesu iya Sunday na Tuesday.",
    "Taking the love of Christ beyond the church walls into Chawama and surrounding communities.": "Ukusenda ukutemwa kwa kwa Kristu ukucila pa fibumba fya cilonganino mu Chawama na mu filonganino fyashingulukako.",
    "Talk to us": "Landa na ifwe",
    "Tell us where you would like to serve, and our team will help you take the next step.": "Tubuulile uko wingatemwa ukubomba, elyo ibumba lyesu likakwafwa ukukonka inshila imbi.",
    "Tell us you are coming and we will help you find us. This form opens WhatsApp with your message ready to send.": "Tubuulile ukuti uleisa kabili tukakwafwa ukutusanga. Iyi fomu ilaisula WhatsApp ne mbila yenu iyaiteyanya ukutuma.",
