    "Healing, fruitfulness, restored marriages, provision, and salvation — these are the stories of God’s faithfulness in our church family.": "Machiritso, kubala zipatso, kubwezeretsedwa kwa maukwati, makonzedwe, ndi chipulumutso—izi ndi nkhani za kukhulupirika kwa Mulungu m’banja la mpingo wathu.",
