    "Our Sunday services, Tuesday services, and prayer sessions are shared on Facebook. Visit the page to watch the latest message or join us live.": "Ntchito zathu za Sunday, misonkhano ya Tuesday, ndi magawo a mapemphero amagawidwa pa Facebook. Pitani patsambali kuti muwone uthenga waposachedwa kapena mubwere nafe pompopompo.",
