    "Our heart is simple: to win souls for Christ and help every believer grow into the fullness of what God has called them to be. Whether you are new to faith or returning after a season away, there is a place for you here.": "Mtima wathu ndi wophweka: kupindula miyoyo kwa Khristu ndi kuthandiza wokhulupirira aliyense kukula mu chidzalo cha chimene Mulungu wawayitanira. Kaya ndinu watsopano ku chikhulupiriro kapena mwabwerako pakapita nyengo, pali malo anu pano.",
    "Our heart is to win souls for Christ, disciple believers, and serve our community with compassion. We gather for Sunday celebration, Tuesday service, prayer and intercession, and times of worship led by our choirs and praise team.": "Mtima wathu ndi kupindula miyoyo kwa Khristu, kuphunzitsa okhulupirira, ndi kutumikira dera lathu ndi chifundo. Tikusonkhana ku chikondwerero cha Sunday, utumiki wa Tuesday, mapemphero ndi mapembedzero, ndi nthawi zopembedzera motsogozedwa ndi makwaya athu ndi timu yotamanda.",
    "Our heritage": "Cholowa chathu cha uzimu",
    "Our main church family gathers in Chawama for Sunday and Tuesday services. Please call ahead for the exact venue and directions.": "Banja lathu lalikulu la tchalitchi limasonkhana mu Chawama pa ntchito za Sunday ndi Tuesday. Chonde imbani kutsogolo kuti mudziwe komwe kudzachitikira komanso mayendedwe ake.",
    "Our main gathering is in Chawama, Lusaka, with a branch being planted in Chongwe. Call the church office for the latest details.": "Msonkhano wathu waukulu uli ku Chawama, Lusaka, ndi nthambi yomwe idabzalidwa ku Chongwe. Imbani ofesi ya tchalitchi kuti mudziwe zambiri.",
    "Our main gathering is in Chawama, Lusaka. Please call ahead for the exact venue, directions, and transport help. A branch is also being planted in Chongwe.": "Msonkhano wathu waukulu uli ku Chawama, Lusaka. Chonde imbani foni kuti mupeze malo enieni, mayendedwe, ndi thandizo lamayendedwe. Nthambi ikubzalidwanso ku Chongwe.",
    "Our ministries": "Utumiki wathu",
