    "Our prayer and intercession sessions are announced on Facebook. Follow the page so you do not miss the next live session.": "Mapemphero athu ndi kupembedzera kwathu akulengezedwa pa Facebook. Tsatirani tsambali kuti musaphonye gawo lotsatira lamoyo.",
    "Our prayer is that the same grace upon AGCOM and SCOAN will continue to rest upon Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia and upon every soul we reach.": "Pemphero lathu ndilakuti chisomo chomwechi pa AGCOM ndi SCOAN chipitilire kukhala pa Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia ndi pa mzimu uliwonse womwe tifika.",
    "Our services include praise, prayer, and practical teaching from Scripture.": "Ntchito zathu zimaphatikizapo kutamanda, kupemphera, ndi kuphunzitsa kothandiza kuchokera m'Malemba.",
