    "Soul winning is the heartbeat of Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia. Jesus came to seek and save the lost, and He has sent every believer to share that same love.": "Kupambana kwa mzimu ndiko kugunda kwa mtima kwa Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia. Yesu anabwera kudzafunafuna ndi kupulumutsa otayika, ndipo watumiza wokhulupirira aliyense kuti agawane nawo chikondi chomwecho.",
