    "Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia is a Christian ministry based in Chawama, Lusaka. We are a family of believers who love God, honour His Word, and believe in the power of the Holy Spirit.": "Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia ndi utumiki wachikhristu wozikidwa ku Chawama, Lusaka. Ndife banja la okhulupirira amene amakonda Mulungu, amalemekeza Mawu ake, komanso amakhulupirira mphamvu ya Mzimu Woyera.",
    "Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia is a Spirit-filled church family in Chawama, Lusaka. We gather to worship God, grow in His Word, pray with faith, and reach our community with the love of Jesus Christ.": "Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia ndi banja la mpingo wodzazidwa ndi Mzimu mu Chawama, Lusaka. Timasonkhana kuti tilambire Mulungu, kukula m’Mawu ake, kupemphera ndi chikhulupiriro, ndi kufikira dera lathu ndi chikondi cha Yesu Khristu.",
