    "Standing in the gap for the church, families, and those in need, and supporting one another with practical love.": "Kuyimirira mumpata wa mpingo, mabanja, ndi iwo osowa, ndi kuthandizana wina ndi mzake ndi chikondi chenicheni.",
    "Standing in the gap for the church, the nation, and those in need through consistent prayer.": "Kuyimirira mumpata kwa mpingo, fuko, ndi iwo osowa kudzera mu pemphero lokhazikika.",
