    "Stay connected": "Khalani olumikizidwa",
    "Stay rooted in Scripture. Keep your heart open to the Holy Spirit. Trust that God is working even when you cannot see the whole picture. His timing is perfect, and His love for you is sure.": "Khalani okhazikika mu Lemba. Khalani otsegukira mtima wanu kwa Mzimu Woyera. Khulupirirani kuti Mulungu akugwira ntchito ngakhale pamene simungathe kuona chithunzi chonse. Nthawi yake ndi yangwiro, ndipo chikondi chake pa inu nchotsimikizika.",
    "Stories of His faithfulness in our church family.": "Nkhani za kukhulupirika kwake mu banja lathu la mpingo.",
