    "Sunday and Tuesday services, choirs, prayer, outreach, and community care continue to reach souls for Christ.": "Sunday ndi Tuesday misonkhano, makwaya, mapemphero, kufalitsa uthenga, ndi chisamaliro cha anthu akupitilira kufikira miyoyo ya Khristu.",
