    "Support the work": "Thandizani ntchito",
    "Support welfare, weddings, funerals, and families walking through hard seasons.": "Thandizani thanzi, maukwati, maliro, ndi mabanja omwe akuyenda munyengo zovuta.",
    "Supporting the work of the ministry, our choirs, and the practical needs of the church.": "Kuthandizira ntchito ya utumiki, makwaya athu, ndi zosowa zenizeni za mpingo.",
    "Take a moment to breathe, read, and pray. God’s Word is a lamp to your feet and a light to your path.": "Tengani kamphindi kupuma, kuwerenga, ndi kupemphera. Mawu a Mulungu ndiwo nyali ya kumapazi ako ndi kuunika kwa njira yako.",
    "Take a moment with God": "Tengani kamphindi ndi Mulungu",
    "Take the Sunday and Tuesday messages home with you.": "Tengani mauthenga a Sunday ndi Tuesday kunyumba kwanu.",
    "Take the message home with you. These short notes gather the themes God has been speaking through our Sunday and Tuesday services.": "Tengani uthengawo kunyumba. Zolemba zazifupizi zimasonkhanitsa mitu yomwe Mulungu wakhala akulankhula kudzera mu ntchito zathu za Sunday ndi Tuesday.",
    "Taking the love of Christ beyond the church walls into Chawama and surrounding communities.": "Kutengera chikondi cha Khristu kupyola mpanda wa mpingo kulowa mu Chawama ndi madera ozungulira.",
    "Talk to us": "Lankhulani nafe",
    "Tell us where you would like to serve, and our team will help you take the next step.": "Tiuzeni komwe mungafune kukatumikira, ndipo gulu lathu likuthandizani kuchitapo kanthu.",
    "Tell us you are coming and we will help you find us. This form opens WhatsApp with your message ready to send.": "Tiuzeni kuti mukubwera ndipo tikuthandizani kuti mupeze. Fomu iyi imatsegula WhatsApp ndi uthenga wanu wokonzeka kutumiza.",
