    "God has given every member a gift. Our ministries work together to serve the church, reach the community, and make room for every person to grow.": "Chiuta wali kupeleka chawanangwa ku chiŵaro chilichose. Uteŵeti withu ukugwira ntchito pamoza kuti uteŵetere mpingo, kufika ku ŵanthu, na kupanga malo ghakuti munthu waliyose wakure.",
