    "Healing": "Kupola",
    "Healing, fruitfulness, restored marriages, provision, and salvation — these are the stories of God’s faithfulness in our church family.": "Kuchizga, kubaba vipambi, nthengwa zakuwezgeka, kupereka, na chiponosko — izi ni nkhani za kugomezgeka kwa Chiuta mu mbumba yithu ya tchalitchi.",
