    "If you need help getting to church, call or WhatsApp the church office. The team will advise you on available transport arrangements and pickup points.": "Usange mukukhumba wovwiri kuti mufike ku tchalitchi, fonani panji WhatsApp ku ofesi ya tchalitchi. Gulu ili lizamumuphalirani vya ndondomeko ya vyakwendekwenda iyo yilipo na malo agho mungatora.",
