    "Our heart is simple: to win souls for Christ and help every believer grow into the fullness of what God has called them to be. Whether you are new to faith or returning after a season away, there is a place for you here.": "Mtima withu ngwambura kusuzga: kusanga mizimu chifukwa cha Khristu na kovwira wakupulikana waliyose kuti wakure mu kuzura kwa ivyo Chiuta waŵachema kuti ŵaŵe. Kwali ndimwe ŵaphya mu chipulikano panji mukuwelera pamanyuma pa nyengo yitali, pali malo gha imwe kuno.",
    "Our heart is to win souls for Christ, disciple believers, and serve our community with compassion. We gather for Sunday celebration, Tuesday service, prayer and intercession, and times of worship led by our choirs and praise team.": "Mtima withu ngwakuti tipokere mizimu chifukwa cha Khristu, ŵasambiri ŵakugomezga, na kuteŵetera ŵanthu ŵa mu chigaŵa chithu na lusungu. Tikuwungana pa chikondwerero cha Sunday, uteŵeti wa Tuesday, lurombo na kuŵeyelera, na nyengo za kusopa izo zikulongozgeka na makwaya ghithu na gulu lakulumba.",
    "Our heritage": "Vya ise vya mzimu",
    "Our main church family gathers in Chawama for Sunday and Tuesday services. Please call ahead for the exact venue and directions.": "Banja lithu likuru la tchalitchi likuwungana mu Chawama ku maungano gha Sunday na Tuesday. Chonde yimbirani foni pambere nyengo yindakwane kuti mumanye malo ghakwenelera na umo mungacitira.",
    "Our main gathering is in Chawama, Lusaka, with a branch being planted in Chongwe. Call the church office for the latest details.": "Ungano withu ukuru uli mu Chawama, Lusaka, ndipo nthambi yikupanda mu Chongwe. Yimbirani foni ofesi ya tchalitchi kuti mumanye vinthu viphya.",
    "Our main gathering is in Chawama, Lusaka. Please call ahead for the exact venue, directions, and transport help. A branch is also being planted in Chongwe.": "Msonkhano withu ukuru uli mu Chawama, Lusaka. Chonde yimbirani foni pambere nyengo yindakwane kuti mumanye malo ghakwenelera, nthowa, na wovwiri wa vyakwendekwenda. Nthambi nayo yikupanda mu Chongwe.",
