    "Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia is a Spirit-filled church family in Chawama, Lusaka. We gather to worship God, grow in His Word, pray with faith, and reach our community with the love of Jesus Christ.": "Souls for Christ Ministries Zambia ni banja la mpingo lakuzura na Mzimu mu Chawama, Lusaka. Tikuwungana kuti tisope Chiuta, kukura mu Mazgu ghake, kulomba na chipulikano, na kufika ku chikaya chithu na chitemwa cha Yesu Khristu.",
